    {
      "id": "claim_55f8fc496ed44505a3d5613bc5a8eb93",
      "statement": "Auth.sync_user_from_token is invoked explicitly by the auth router's POST /auth/token (password grant) and POST /auth/sync (called by the frontend right after the PKCE callback) to unconditionally refresh identity and role in the DB, ensuring a fresh User row before subsequent business-logic requests.",
