      "statement": "validate_ownership is defined in authorization.py as the most permissive owner-or-elevated-role check but is not invoked by any controller in the codebase; controllers instead use validate_owner_or_superadmin (excludes guarantor) or validate_guarantor_or_superadmin/validate_superadmin for elevated-only moderation actions.",
