      "statement": "The Keycloak dev realm (praktikai-dev) defines exactly the four realm roles matching UserRole (user, lector, guarantor, superadmin) with 'user' as the default role for new registrations, a confidential 'app' client with service accounts enabled (used for both password-grant login and Admin API role lookups), and a public PKCE-only 'praktik-ai-app' SPA client with no direct access grants.",
